              <run fontcolor='#C9D6E3' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='9'>&#10;Who is consistent and who is explosive? Who adds the most value per match? Who scores fastest at the death? Who bowls tightest in the powerplay and at the death? Who is improving or declining?</run>
